  "question": {
    "text": "The intensity of gamma radiation from a given source is I. On passing through $36 \\mathrm{~mm}$ of lead, it is reduced to $\\frac{I}{8}$. The thickness of lead which will reduce the intensity to $\\frac{I}{2}$ will be",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
